  "summary": "Wrote docs/research/pbo-cscv.md as an implementation-grade PBO/CSCV literature note from Bailey et al. (JCF 2017 / SSRN 2326253). The note covers sources, the T×N input matrix M, the full CSCV algorithm with paper notation and pseudocode, complexity for practical S, a hand-worked S=4/N=3/T=8 test vector with all 6 splits and PBO=1/2, and implementation pitfalls including which non-PBO diagnostics are out of v0.1 scope.",
